paragraph.content:
ensuring the collection of data required to be collected under clause (viii) of section
 105(d)(7)(Q) of the Trafficking Victims Protection Act of 2000 (22 U.S.C.
 7103(d)(7)(Q)), as added by section 17 of the Abolish Human Trafficking Act of 2017, is sought;

coordinating, promoting, and supporting the work of the Department of Justice relating to human
 trafficking, including investigation, prosecution, training, outreach,
 victim support, grant-making, and policy activities;
